{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41850","headline":"游北山洞神宫 · 李中","name":"游北山洞神宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闷见尘中光景促，仙乡来礼紫阳君。\n人居淡寂应难老，道在虚无不可闻。\n松桧稳栖三岛鹤，楼台闲锁九霄云。\n羡师向此朝星斗，一炷清香午夜焚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}